### module-droid-card and module-droid-hidl are loaded synchronously at PA startup.
### PulseAudio startup is gated on /proc/asound/card0/cpe0_state == ONLINE via
### pulseaudio.service.d/50-adsp-wait.conf, so the ADSP APR channel is ready
### before these modules load. This matches upstream droid-hal-configs and
### removes the need for the perseus-specific delayed-loading service.
load-module module-droid-card rate=48000 use_legacy_stream_set_parameters=true
load-module module-droid-hidl
set-default-sink sink.primary_output
